sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor FE as Frontend
    participant BFF as Checkout BFF
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant RMQ as RabbitMQ
    participant Worker as Payment Worker

    Note over FE,Worker: Async Checkout Flow

    FE->>BFF: POST /operations/checkout/async {cartId, paymentMethodId}
    BFF->>DB: Validate cart exists & PENDING
    BFF->>DB: Validate payment method offered for cart
    BFF->>DB: Create CheckoutOperation (PENDING)
    BFF->>DB: Insert OutboxEvent (PAYMENT_REQUEST)
    BFF-->>FE: 202 Accepted {checkoutId}

    Note over BFF,RMQ: Outbox Relay (background)
    par Outbox Relay
        BFF->>DB: SELECT unpublished outbox events
        DB-->>BFF: PAYMENT_REQUEST event
        BFF->>RMQ: Publish to checkout.exchange (payment.request)
        RMQ-->>BFF: ACK
        BFF->>DB: UPDATE outbox SET published_at = now()
    end

    Note over RMQ,Worker: Payment Worker Consumes
    RMQ->>Worker: Deliver PAYMENT_REQUEST
    Worker->>DB: Check idempotency (checkoutId processed?)
    alt Already Processed
        Worker->>RMQ: ACK (duplicate)
    else New Request
        Worker->>DB: Update CheckoutOperation (PROCESSING)
        Worker->>Worker: Simulate payment processing
        alt Card ending in 0002
            Worker->>DB: Update CheckoutOperation (DECLINED)
            Worker->>DB: Insert OutboxEvent (PAYMENT_PROCESSED - DECLINED)
        else Valid payment
            Worker->>DB: Update CheckoutOperation (APPROVED)
            Worker->>DB: Update ShoppingCart (PAID, paid_at)
            Worker->>DB: Insert OutboxEvent (PAYMENT_PROCESSED - APPROVED)
        else Error
            Worker->>DB: Update CheckoutOperation (FAILED)
            Worker->>DB: Insert OutboxEvent (PAYMENT_PROCESSED - FAILED)
        end
        Worker->>RMQ: ACK
    end

    Note over FE,BFF: Status Polling
    loop Until terminal state
        FE->>BFF: GET /operations/checkouts/{checkoutId}
        BFF->>DB: SELECT CheckoutOperation
        BFF-->>FE: 200 {status, paymentDetails}
    end